[00:04.29](Psalm 29:11)
[00:08.59]1. Like an island of calm
[00:12.88]In dark stormy seas,
[00:17.18]God’s people are living in peace.
[00:25.34]With our eyes of faith,
[00:27.61]We see beyond the clouds
[00:29.87]And know that the storm
[00:32.14]soon will cease.
[00:35.09](Chorus)
[00:38.04]To the ends of the earth,
[00:41.49]There’ll be peace at last
[00:44.94]For all eternity.
[00:50.88]From the valleys below
[00:53.21]To the mountaintops,
[00:55.54]All creation will see
[00:57.88]Peace at last.
[01:00.88]2. When the new world is here,
[01:03.88]All will be one
[01:19.58]On earth and in heaven above.
[01:24.57]And the peace we’ll know
[01:28.22]We’ve never known before—
[01:32.92]A world ruled by justice and love.
[01:37.12](Chorus)
[01:39.42]To the ends of the earth,
[01:41.72]There’ll be peace at last
[01:44.02]For all eternity.
[01:50.02]From the valleys below
[01:57.31]To the mountaintops,
[02:22.08]All creation will see
[02:28.08]Peace at last.
[02:34.08](Chorus)
[02:47.08]To the ends of the earth,
[03:06.82]There’ll be peace at last
[03:08.80]For all eternity.
[03:10.77]From the valleys below
[03:12.75]To the mountaintops,
[03:14.73]All creation will see.
[03:16.71](Chorus)
[03:18.69]To the ends of the earth,
[03:20.66]There’ll be peace at last
[03:22.64]For all eternity.
[03:24.62]From the valleys below
[03:26.60]To the mountaintops,
[03:28.57]All creation will see
[03:30.55]Peace at last,
[03:32.53]Peace at last!